{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.102:0.1", "PA_thag_1.102:0.2", "PA_thag_1.102:0.3"], "en": "Theragāthā 1.102 Ekakanipāta Ekādasamavagga", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.102:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Setuccha:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.102:1.1"], "en": "“Deceived by conceit,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.102:1.2"], "en": "you are defiled amidst conditioned phenomena;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.102:1.3"], "en": "“Tossed about by gain and loss,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.102:1.4"], "en": "they do not attain concentration.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.102:1.5"], "en": "… Thus spoke the Elder Setuccha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
